  "details": "When you go to your vrchat website to check the friends list\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/favorites/friend/group_0\n\nThe division is so weird, you have offline offline person then online orange, green status person.\n\nIn vrchat itself it's much easier, you have people who are sorted by blue status first, then green status, then orange status then red status , can we also have this on the vrchat website? That way it's much easier if i want to see if a friend is online or not, then i don't have to login to the game to see whether people are available or not, and i can just easily see if people are online based on the vrchat website.",
